  "description": "A zero-allocation OpenTelemetry (OTLP) log exporter for .NET. Bypasses the official SDK to serialize logs directly into raw Protobuf bytes via a lock-free batcher, delivering 22x faster execution and zero GC pressure for extreme-throughput microservices.",
